</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I’m tired of sin, footsore and weary,</l><l>The darksome path hath dreary grown,</l><l>But now a light has ris’n to cheer me;</l><l>I find in Thee my Star, my Sun.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Thy precious will, O conqu’ring Savior,</l><l>Doth now embrace and compass me;</l><l>All discords hushed, my peace a river,</l><l>My soul a prisoned bird set free.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Shut in with Thee, O Lord, forever,</l><l>My wayward feet no more to roam;</l><l>What pow’r from Thee my soul can sever?</l><l>The center of God’s will my home.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
